# Risk 5 — Vanta ↔ DC 5 Cross-Check

## Goal
Every claim in DC 5 of the new draft must match a control that Vanta tests (cadence, scope, tool names, description). Mismatches become audit findings.

## Inputs
- New draft: Google Doc `1lnb6Lu4ZWnwuQTGjpH1ijteMgTS9olCz1et4LBEhbBs`
- Vanta EU portal: app.eu.vanta.com (per memory `reference_vanta_eu`)
- Internal UCF: `projects/current-ucf/control-register.csv` + `mappings/soc2-view.csv`

## Method
1. Extract every CC1–CC9 claim from the new draft (cadence, tool, owner, frequency)
2. Map each claim to Vanta controls via UCF mapping
3. For each pair, flag: ✅ match, ⚠️ wording drift, 🔴 contradiction

## Output (in this artifact)
- Reconciliation table: claim | Vanta control | match status | proposed fix
- Edits applied to the new doc (in place) for any 🔴 or ⚠️
- Open questions for user only on real decisions

